# INVWINBB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:BYCATW.CFG, TEST/WIN/BYCATW.CFG, whose WINPANE.CAT=1,30 makes the
# categories 30 characters wide, on the sixty items of PART of
# TEST/KEYS/RLLONG.REQ and the categories of TEST/KEYS/BYCATL.REQ,
# thirty-eight more than the ten of a new data directory, C30 with an
# item: a list of categories longer than its window, which CAT LIST
# returns whole and the list pages itself.  Items > Browse by category
# shows the first page and counts all forty-eight; PGDN twice shows the
# second and the third page, END the last category, PGUP the page above
# and HOME the first again.  PART has more items than their window
# shows, counted beside it; one of them edited into MOBO leaves them,
# counted again.  A category added in Items > Categories' dialog over
# the list is counted when the dialog closes.  From the end, C30 shows
# its item beside it.  Its sort order set to 0 moves it to the top of
# the first page, where it is selected again; a new category ZZ of order
# 99 is selected at the end of the last; CPU deleted on the first page
# is counted off.  With ZZ selected again, View > Pane beside the list
# shows the categories alone on that row, and ENTER and ESC come back to
# it.  The end by Exit: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/BYCATW.CFG is the settings file
# it leaves, the pane hidden and the width kept.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINBB.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I T
S PAGE1
K PGDN
S PAGE2
K PGDN
S PAGE3
K END
S END
K PGUP
S PGUP
K HOME
S HOME
K DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN DOWN
S PART
K F6
S SIXTY
K CTRL-E
T M
K ENTER
S RECAT
K ESC ALT-I C ALT-N
T AA
K TAB
T Added in the dialog
K ENTER ESC
S DIALOG
K END UP UP UP UP UP UP UP UP
S C30
K CTRL-E TAB
T 0
K ENTER
S FIRST
K INS
T ZZ
K TAB
T Last one
K TAB
T 99
K ENTER
S LAST
K HOME DOWN DOWN DOWN DEL Y
S DELETED
K END ALT-V P
S ALONE
K ENTER
S OPENED
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-F X
